941::$$$message_0003_0000_0000$$$::   I'd better not.[lr]::
942::$$$message_0003_0000_0001$$$::It's probably just one of the monks.[lr]::
943::$$$message_0003_0000_0002$$$::We aren't the only people at Ryudou Temple.[lr]::
944::$$$message_0003_0000_0003$$$::I think someone's outside, but worrying about it won't get me anywhere.[lr]::
945::$$$message_0003_0000_0004$$$::That'll just put an end to this fun training camp.::
946::$$$message_0003_0001_0000$$$::"...Right, yeah. Anyway, where's the toilet..."[lr]::
947::$$$message_0003_0001_0001$$$::I pick up my pace and start down the corridor at a jog.[lr]::
948::$$$message_0003_0001_0002$$$::This ghost story has only just begun.[lr]::
949::$$$message_0003_0001_0003$$$::It's going to be a long tale.[lr]::
950::$$$message_0003_0001_0004$$$::That's why, right now, [wait canskip=0 time=400]I don't need to pay attention to anything. [wait canskip=0 time=400]Let me immerse myself in this long night.[lr]:	O